  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: connection reuse with a mismatching TLS configuration for\n     STARTTLS protocols\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-8286.patch: also require a matching SSL\n       configuration when looking for a connection to reuse for a transfer that\n       may upgrade to TLS from a clear-text start in lib/url.c\n     - CVE-2026-8286\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: connection reuse across different GSS-API service names\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-8458.patch: keep the service name and the proxy\n       service name on the connection and compare them when looking for a\n       connection to reuse in lib/urldata.h, lib/url.c and lib/http_negotiate.c\n     - CVE-2026-8458",
